      "content": "That's a good start, but it's a bit too brief. Could you expand on the section about the tardiness? I want it to feel a bit more personalized so they understand the impact it's having on the rest of the team, without being overly harsh or aggressive. Maybe something that explains how their absence affects the flow of the morning?",
