    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I just want to make sure they don't feel like I'm picking on them. Do you have any advice on how to handle the feedback if they get defensive or make excuses about their schedule? Like, how do I keep the conversation focused on the professional impact rather than getting into personal details?",
